                    {
                        "sense_id": "69c3cd69-c247-3eb5-8679-9e23ed0d1cc4",
                        "entry_id": "7328d635-5e3c-3c1a-bb00-92f5c63902b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The action of the verb to shape."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d57bb490-d688-4832-82d1-0e2ae9fbcb69",
                                "sense_id": "69c3cd69-c247-3eb5-8679-9e23ed0d1cc4",
                                "text": "In contrast to the (to be sure, productive) shapings and constrainings of human identities in the sociotechnical network, here we have an expansion of identity."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5572e9c5-a71e-31be-a8e1-c6f01a52e0ed",
                        "entry_id": "7328d635-5e3c-3c1a-bb00-92f5c63902b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The action of the verb to shape.",
                            "A method of positive reinforcement of behaviour patterns in a series of steps in operant conditioning."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dd974cd-5f4f-4b6e-8bfc-95e96c3eaa88",
                                "sense_id": "5572e9c5-a71e-31be-a8e1-c6f01a52e0ed",
                                "text": "In general, it's a good idea to know ahead of time what your shaping steps will be and try to get 80% to 100% correct trials during the shaping steps and repeat each step for only 5 to 10 trials in a row."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "967d00be-2e2f-3a8f-a274-b026e8b3a352",
                        "entry_id": "7328d635-5e3c-3c1a-bb00-92f5c63902b9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The action of the verb to shape.",
                            "The action of the metal-cutting machine called a shaper, which uses linear single-point cutting. It is largely but not entirely obsolete."
